2	 * Single source of truth for the manual-annotation palette: each ToolItem
3	 * drives the palette button, its keyboard shortcut, and the keyboard legend
4	 * simultaneously. Round boundaries aren't here — real Round rows already
5	 * exist from AI segmentation (see ai/fight_processing/write_frames_and_rounds).
6	 * Only "fight end" stays manual since no stage detects a fight's conclusion.
