**Blocks:** [Stage 1](03-stage1-artifacts.md) steps 6 & 8 (need the labelled set); [P4](01-prerequisite.md#p4) (needs [0c(5)](02b-label-schema.md#0c-5)); [Stage 2](04-stage2-model.md) (needs labelled training data).

